---
import LandingPageLayout from "../layouts/LandingPageLayout.astro"
import Button from "../components/Button.astro"
import Text from "../components/text/Text.astro"
import H1 from "../components/text/H1.astro";
import H2 from '../components/text/H2.astro';
import H3 from '../components/text/H3.astro';
import ServiceDetailsToggle from "../components/ServiceDetailsToggle.astro";
import FAQ from '../components/FAQ.astro';

const headContent = {
  metaTitle: "Custom website design for Yuma Small Businesses",
  metaDescription: 'Web design service for small businesses based in Yuma, AZ. A simple process to build a successful website that increases your profits.',
}

const FAQs = [
  {
    title: "How long does it take to build a website?",
    content: [
      "The time it takes to build a website varies on the size and scope of the project.\
       For an average website project you might expect the timeline to look like this:",
      "Planning phase: 1 – 2 weeks<br>Production phase: 6 – 8 weeks<br>Wrap up and launch: 1 week"       
    ]
  },
  {
    title: "What do you need from me to get started?",
    content: [
      "All you need to do is schedule a project planning call. This is the first step. After that, we work on collecting from you all the information we need to complete the project."       
    ]
  },
  {
    title: "What forms of payment do you accept?",
    content: [
      "We accept multiple payment methods. You can pay via credit card or bank transfer."       
    ]
  },
  {
    title: "What if I change my mind?",
    content: [
      "If you change your mind, you can cancel the project, and we’ll refund you 100% of your money. And if you dislike the website design, you can request a refund anytime before the website design is finalized."       
    ]
  },
  {
    title: "What happens if I make a late payment?",
    content: [
      "We understand that certain circumstances can cause late payments. So we give a grace period of 7 days to complete the payment. After that, we add a 10% fee to the amount due."       
    ]
  },
]

---


<LandingPageLayout headContent={headContent} headerButtonLink='#schedule-call-section'>
  <meta slot="head" name="robots" content="noindex">

  <section class="flex justify-center bg-blue-gradient px-32 md:px-53 lg:px-59 py-85 md:py-154">
    <div class="grow-1 flex flex-col gap-32 md:gap-36 max-w-1281">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-20 md:gap-36">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-5">
          <img class="w-20 md:w-24" src="/icons/pin-white.svg" alt="location pin" width="24" height="24">
          <p class="text-16 md:text-21 text-parchment">Based in Yuma, AZ.</p>
        </div>
        <H1 class="max-w-360 md:max-w-450 lg:max-w-600">Are you losing clients because of your website?</H1>
        <Text class="text-parchment max-w-450 md:max-w-520 lg:max-w-570">
          Get a website that actually convinces people to work with you instead of pushing them away.
        </Text>
      </div>
      <Button link="#schedule-call-section" class='self-start' data-umami-event="hero-cta-btn">Book a call today</Button>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="flex justify-center lg:px-95 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="grow-1 flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-20 md:gap-38 lg:gap-54 max-w-1281">

      <div class="lg:basis-486 lg:grow-1 flex flex-col gap-20 md:gap-36 px-32 md:px-95 lg:px-0 pb-32 pt-53 md:pb-53 md:pt-95 lg:py-95 bg-blue">
        <H2 color="parchment">Lots of effort, <span class="text-electric">not enough</span> results</H2>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-22">
          <Text class="text-parchment">
            This happens a lot. You’ve got a website, and you’ve invested time and money into it. 
            You expect the website to really help you get new business, but it doesn’t perform like you hoped. 
          </Text>
          <Text class="text-parchment">
            You have a great business.
            People love working with you.
            So you expect your website to attract new clients.
          </Text>
          <Text class="text-parchment">
            But it doesn’t. 
            Worse yet, it <span class="underline">might even dissuade</span> potential clients instead of persuade them. 
          </Text>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="triangle-separator absolute w-0 h-0 -z-1 
        -translate-y-20 md:-translate-y-38 lg:-translate-y-0 lg:-translate-x-54 
        border-t-40 md:border-t-76 lg:border-t-800 xl:border-t-700 
        border-s-[100vw] lg:border-s-0 lg:border-e-108 border-[transparent] border-t-blue"></div>
        <div class="beginning-block absolute w-1000 h-1000 bg-blue -translate-x-1300 -z-1 hidden md:block"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:basis-615 lg:grow-1 flex flex-col gap-20 md:gap-36 px-32 md:px-95 lg:px-0 lg:ps-36 pt-32 pb-53 md:pt-53 md:pb-95 lg:py-95">
        <H2>A good website <span class="text-spark">increases your revenue</span></H2>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-22">
          <Text>
            You need a great business to have a successful website. 
            But when potential clients visit your website and do nothing, it’s not the business’ problem. The website has the problem.
          </Text>
          <Text>
            If you build a website the right way, you will see these results:
          </Text>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-14">
            <div class="flex gap-18 ps-18">
              <div class="pt-8 md:pt-11 lg:pt-12">
                <svg width="8" height="8" viewBox="0 0 8 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                  <circle cx="4" cy="4" r="4" fill="#222F2F"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <Text>You will stop repelling potential clients.</Text>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-18 ps-18">
              <div class="pt-8 md:pt-11 lg:pt-12">
                <svg width="8" height="8" viewBox="0 0 8 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                  <circle cx="4" cy="4" r="4" fill="#222F2F"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <Text>More visitors will actually pick up the phone and call you.</Text>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-18 ps-18">
              <div class="pt-8 md:pt-11 lg:pt-12">
                <svg width="8" height="8" viewBox="0 0 8 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                  <circle cx="4" cy="4" r="4" fill="#222F2F"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <Text>You will receive more business. And <span class="text-spark font-semibold">this means increased revenue</span>.</Text>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="flex flex-col items-center xl:px-95 bg-charcoal">
    <div class="grow-1 flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center py-59 pb-0 lg:py-0 max-w-623 md:max-w-751 lg:max-w-1400 xl:max-w-1210">
      <div class="relative lg:basis-645 xl:basis-550 px-22 lg:ps-95 xl:ps-0 pb-22">
        <picture>
          <source
            media="(min-width: 1150px)"
            srcset="/images/headshot-owner-jakin-stahl-528x785.webp"
            width="528"
            height="785"
          />
          <img
            src="/images/headshot-owner-jakin-stahl-632x704.webp"
            alt="Headshot of the owner Jakin Stahl"
            width="316"
            height="352"
            loading="lazy"
            class="rounded-md w-316 md:w-416 lg:w-528 h-auto object-cover object-center"
          />
        </picture>
        <div class="absolute right-0 bottom-0 flex flex-row items-center gap-30 md:gap-36 bg-blue px-22 py-14 rounded-md">
          <div class="flex flex-col">
            <p class="text-16 md:text-23/[150%] lg:text-27/[150%] font-semibold text-parchment">Jakin Stahl</p>
            <p class="text-12 md:text-16 text-parchment">Owner, Designer and Developer</p>
          </div>
          <img class="w-34 md:w-56" src="/images/webcharged-icon-white.svg" alt="WebCharged icon" width="55" height="65">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:basis-754 xl:basis-660 flex flex-col gap-59 px-32 md:px-53 lg:px-59 xl:pe-0 py-59">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-36">
          <H2 color="electric">Wesite design done for you</H2>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-20">
            <Text class='text-parchment'>
              Are you tired of investing all your time into your website? 
              Let us do the website design for you. 
              Then you can focus on doing what you do best. 
            </Text>
            <Text class='text-parchment'>
              Here is what you’ll get:
            </Text>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-36">
            <div class="flex flex-col p-9 ps-36 gap-8 border-s-8 border-parchment rounded-md">
              <h3 class="text-16 md:text-19 lg:text-21 font-semibold text-electric">Effective website content</h3>
              <Text class='text-parchment'>
                We will work together with you to create content that turns visitors into paying clients.
              </Text>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col p-9 ps-36 gap-8 border-s-8 border-parchment rounded-md">
              <h3 class="text-16 md:text-19 lg:text-21 font-semibold text-electric">High-quality, engaging designs</h3>
              <Text class='text-parchment'>
                You will have a custom design that fits your company. 
                Your design will start captivating visitors, making them want to keep browsing on your website.
              </Text>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col p-9 ps-36 gap-8 border-s-8 border-parchment rounded-md">
              <h3 class="text-16 md:text-19 lg:text-21 font-semibold text-electric">Professional website development</h3>
              <Text class='text-parchment'>
                You will get a website that is built to be fast. 
                It will look good on all screen sizes, so you can impress the potential clients visiting your website on their phones.
              </Text>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
        <Button class="self-center lg:self-start" link="#schedule-call-section" data-umami-event="middle-section-btn-1">Get started</Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="flex flex-col items-center px-32 md:px-53 lg:px-59 py-59 bg-blue gap-36">
    <H2 color="parchment">A new website with <span class="text-electric">little effort</span></H2>
    <div class="grow-1 flex flex-col gap-22 max-w-559 md:max-w-617">
      <Text class="text-parchment">
        When you sign up for our website design service, you can get a new website with a <span class='text-electric font-semibold'>painless experience</span>.
      </Text>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-14">
        <div class="flex gap-18 ps-18">
          <div class="pt-8 md:pt-11 lg:pt-12">
            <svg width="8" height="8" viewBox="0 0 8 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <circle cx="4" cy="4" r="4" fill="#FFF7EB"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <Text class='text-parchment'>We don’t make you write the content.</Text>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-18 ps-18">
          <div class="pt-8 md:pt-11 lg:pt-12">
            <svg width="8" height="8" viewBox="0 0 8 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <circle cx="4" cy="4" r="4" fill="#FFF7EB"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <Text class='text-parchment'>We take the responsibility of choosing the right photos. (either using yours or getting them ourselves)</Text>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-18 ps-18">
          <div class="pt-8 md:pt-11 lg:pt-12">
            <svg width="8" height="8" viewBox="0 0 8 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <circle cx="4" cy="4" r="4" fill="#FFF7EB"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <Text class='text-parchment'>We brainstorm how to put the content into an engaging design.</Text>
        </div>
      </div>
      <Text class="text-parchment">
        And for any small tasks you may need to complete, we will be there to help you.
      </Text>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="flex flex-col items-center px-32 md:px-53 lg:px-95 py-59 md:py-95 gap-53 md:gap-59">
    <H2>Here's what we built for a Yuma business</H2>
    <div class="grow-1 w-full flex flex-col md:flex-row-reverse flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-y-53 gap-x-95 max-w-1091">
      <div class="shrink-0 flex flex-col items-center gap-22 md:gap-36">
        <picture>
          <!-- Mobile: loads on screens 750px and under -->
          <source
            srcset="/images/freedom-christian-preschool-website.webp"
            media="(max-width: 750px)"
            type="image/webp"
            width="440"
            height="318"
          >
          <!-- Desktop: default fallback -->
          <img
            src="/images/freedom-christian-preschool-website-large.webp"
            alt="Freedom Christian Preschool website"
            width="720"
            height="521"
            loading="lazy"
            class="w-220 md:w-360 z-101 relative"
          >
        </picture>
        <a href="https://fcpyuma.org" target="_blank" class="underline underline-offset-2 hover:no-underline text-16/[200%] md:text-19/[200%]" data-umami-event="fcp-link">View the live site</a>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-22 max-w-559 md:max-w-617 lg:max-w-none md:w-430 grow-1 md:shrink-0">
        <Text>
          Freedom Christian Preschool was brand new. 
          <span class="font-semibold">No website, no online presence.</span>
          They just had a vision for what they wanted to build. 
          They needed a site that would represent them professionally and give interested families a simple way to get started.
        </Text>
        <Text>
          <span class="font-semibold">We built it from scratch</span>. The site covers their programs, curriculum, pricing, and the story behind the school. 
          Most importantly, it gives parents an easy way to schedule a tour (which is the main action that gets parents to enroll).
        </Text>
        <Text>
          They put the web address on their billboards, fliers, and ads. Everything points back to it.
        </Text>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="flex flex-col items-center px-32 md:px-53 py-95 gap-95 bg-charcoal">
    <div class="grow-1 flex flex-col items-center gap-59 lg:gap-95 max-w-559 lg:max-w-633">
      <H2 class="text-center text-electric">Custom website design</H2>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-59">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-36">
          <div role="radiogroup" aria-label="Payment type" class="switch-wrapper relative inline-flex p-8 rounded-full bg-blue">
            <input id="monthly" class="absolute -left-9999" type="radio" name="switch" checked>
            <input id="one-time" class="absolute -left-9999" type="radio" name="switch" >
            <label for="monthly" class="text-center font-semibold text-14 lg:text-16 z-1 min-w-105 lg:min-w-128 cursor-pointer rounded-full transition-color transition-background ease-out duration-150 py-5 lg:py-9 px-21 lg:px-28 text-parchment hover:bg-charcoal/25">Monthly</label>
            <label for="one-time" class="text-center font-semibold text-14 lg:text-16 z-1 min-w-105 lg:min-w-128 cursor-pointer rounded-full transition-color transition-background ease-out duration-150 py-5 lg:py-9 px-21 lg:px-28 text-parchment hover:bg-charcoal/25">One-Time</label>
            <span class="highlighter absolute top-8 left-8 w-[calc(50%-0.5rem)] h-[calc(100%-1rem)] rounded-full bg-parchment transition-transform ease-out duration-150"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-20 md:gap-36 px-20 md:px-36 py-32 md:py-36 bg-blue border-2 border-electric rounded-md">
            <div id="one-time-price" class="hidden flex flex-col items-center gap-8">
              <p class="text-23 md:text-28 lg:text-36 text-parchment font-semibold">$2995</p>
              <Text class="text-parchment text-center">(One-time cost)</Text>
            </div>
            <div id="monthly-price" class="flex flex-col items-center gap-8">
              <div class="flex items-end gap-5 md:gap-8">
                <p class="text-23 md:text-28 lg:text-36 text-parchment font-semibold">$295</p>
                <p class="text-16/[120%] md:text-19/[120%] lg:text-23 text-parchment font-semibold pb-2 md:pb-4">/ month</p>
              </div>
              <Text class="text-parchment text-center">(For 12 months)</Text>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-14">
              <div class="flex flex-row gap-9">
                <svg class='shrink-0 md:w-32 md:h-32' xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" height="24px" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="24px" fill="#FFF7EB"><path d="M382-240 154-468l57-57 171 171 367-367 57 57-424 424Z"/></svg>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 md:py-1 lg:py-0">
                  <h3 class="text-16 md:text-19 lg:text-21 font-semibold text-electric">Custom, engaging design</h3>
                  <p class="text-parchment text-16 lg:text-19">
                    You get a custom-designed website, not a template. A design created to be engaging and appealing.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex flex-row gap-9">
                <svg class='shrink-0 md:w-32 md:h-32' xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" height="24px" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="24px" fill="#FFF7EB"><path d="M382-240 154-468l57-57 171 171 367-367 57 57-424 424Z"/></svg>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 md:py-1 lg:py-0">
                  <h3 class="text-16 md:text-19 lg:text-21 font-semibold text-electric">Designed to match your business</h3>
                  <p class="text-parchment text-16 lg:text-19">
                    Your design will fit with your business. You don’t get a generic <i>one-design-fits-all</i> solution.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex flex-row gap-9">
                <svg class='shrink-0 md:w-32 md:h-32' xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" height="24px" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="24px" fill="#FFF7EB"><path d="M382-240 154-468l57-57 171 171 367-367 57 57-424 424Z"/></svg>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 md:py-1 lg:py-0">
                  <h3 class="text-16 md:text-19 lg:text-21 font-semibold text-electric">Copywriting</h3>
                  <p class="text-parchment text-16 lg:text-19">
                    We do the copywriting for your website. No need for you to figure out how to word your website correctly.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex flex-row gap-9">
                <svg class='shrink-0 md:w-32 md:h-32' xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" height="24px" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="24px" fill="#FFF7EB"><path d="M382-240 154-468l57-57 171 171 367-367 57 57-424 424Z"/></svg>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 md:py-1 lg:py-0">
                  <h3 class="text-16 md:text-19 lg:text-21 font-semibold text-electric">Website photos assistance</h3>
                  <p class="text-parchment text-16 lg:text-19">
                    We take charge of finding photos, whether it be your photos, stock photos or taking new ones.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex flex-row gap-9">
                <svg class='shrink-0 md:w-32 md:h-32' xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" height="24px" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="24px" fill="#FFF7EB"><path d="M382-240 154-468l57-57 171 171 367-367 57 57-424 424Z"/></svg>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 md:py-1 lg:py-0">
                  <h3 class="text-16 md:text-19 lg:text-21 font-semibold text-electric">Mobile-friendly website</h3>
                  <p class="text-parchment text-16 lg:text-19">
                    Readable, usable and good-looking on small screen sizes.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex flex-row gap-9">
                <svg class='shrink-0 md:w-32 md:h-32' xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" height="24px" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="24px" fill="#FFF7EB"><path d="M382-240 154-468l57-57 171 171 367-367 57 57-424 424Z"/></svg>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 md:py-1 lg:py-0">
                  <h3 class="text-16 md:text-19 lg:text-21 font-semibold text-electric">Fast-loading website</h3>
                  <p class="text-parchment text-16 lg:text-19">
                    Your website will load fast because we follow best practices for creating websites with speed.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex flex-row gap-9">
                <svg class='shrink-0 md:w-32 md:h-32' xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" height="24px" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="24px" fill="#FFF7EB"><path d="M382-240 154-468l57-57 171 171 367-367 57 57-424 424Z"/></svg>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 md:py-1 lg:py-0">
                  <h3 class="text-16 md:text-19 lg:text-21 font-semibold text-electric">Analytics Setup</h3>
                  <p class="text-parchment text-16 lg:text-19">
                    We add analytics to your website so you know how many visitors your website gets and which pages perform the best.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col gap-20 px-14 py-32 md:px-32 border-t-2 border-b-2 border-electric">
          <Text class="text-parchment">
            That's <span class="text-electric font-semibold">less than $10 a day</span> (less than most people spend getting lunch) 
            for a website that's working 24/7 to bring in new clients.
          </Text>
          <Text class="text-parchment">
            For most service businesses, a single new client easily pays for an entire month's investment. 
            But the real question isn't whether you can afford a professional website. 
            It's whether you can <span class="text-electric font-semibold">afford not having one</span>. 
            How many jobs are you losing to a competitor with <span class="italic font-semibold">a better website</span>?
          </Text>
        </div>

        <Button fixedWidth={{ isFixed: true, maxWidthClass: 'max-w-287' }} link="#schedule-call-section" data-umami-event="middle-section-btn-2">Get started</Button>
      </div>
      <div class="self-stretch toggle-group flex flex-col gap-20 md:gap-36">
        <ServiceDetailsToggle title="Pricing Details">
          <p>
            Price may vary if the project is extra complicated, needs a special feature, or requires more pages than normal.
          </p>
          <p>
            After determining your project needs, we set the price. Then you’ll approve it before the project starts. There will be no hidden costs.
          </p>
        </ServiceDetailsToggle>
        <ServiceDetailsToggle title="Hosting and Privacy Policies">
          <p>
            Our website design service <span class="font-semibold">covers all website costs for 12 months</span>: hosting, analytics, auto-updating privacy policies, and more.
          </p>
          <div>
            <p class='mb-14'>
              After that, the costs are simple:
            </p>
            <ul class="ms-9 list-disc list-inside">
              <li><span class="underline">$25/month</span>: hosting + software</li>
              <li><span class="underline">$10/month</span>: auto-updating policies</li>        
            </ul>
          </div>
          <p>
            (All of this is included in our support plans as well.)
          </p>
        </ServiceDetailsToggle>
      </div>      
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-36 py-53 md:py-95 md:px-59 border-y-2 border-electric max-w-559 md:max-w-705">
      <H2 class="text-center" color='electric'>Complete website support</H2>
      <Text class='text-parchment'>
        We provide you with <span class="font-semibold">unlimited (100%) support for 12 months</span> after the launch of your website. This means:
      </Text>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-36">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 ps-36 border-s-5 border-parchment rounded-md">
          <Text class="text-electric font-semibold">Answers for questions</Text>
          <Text class="text-parchment">Have a question about your website? Just ask us.</Text>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 ps-36 border-s-5 border-parchment rounded-md">
          <Text class="text-electric font-semibold">Fixes of website bugs</Text>
